sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as API
  participant S as Private storage
  participant Q as Queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant D as Database
  U->>A: Upload with consent and CSRF token
  A->>A: Check type, size, pages, pixels. Strip metadata
  A->>S: Store sanitised original
  A->>D: Prescription, consent, queued job
  A->>Q: Enqueue identifier
  A-->>U: 202 received
  Q->>W: Job
  W->>S: Read original
  W->>W: Pre-process and OCR
  W->>W: Drop instruction and personal lines. Extract fields
  W->>W: Match candidates. Never select one
  W->>D: Items with status needs_verification
  U->>A: Poll status
  A-->>U: Items, candidates, image route
  U->>A: Confirm a candidate (or correct, reject, unresolved)
  A->>A: Candidate? Look-alike acknowledged? Strength agrees?
  A->>D: status verified plus verification event
